# 3. Borrowed Books Set

## Key

```text
borrowed_books:{roll_no}
```

Example:

```text
borrowed_books:B210001CS
```

## Redis Set Members

```text
1234
5678
9012
```

Where each member is a `biblio_id`.

---

## Purpose

Used for Book Detail page.

### Check if current user has borrowed the book

```python
redis.sismember(
    f"borrowed_books:{roll_no}",
    biblio_id
)
```

### UI Logic

```text
If borrowed:
    Show Renew button

Else:
    Show Check Availability button
```

This avoids a Koha request every time a Book Detail page is opened.

