# Data Flow

## Login

```text
Flutter
 ↓
Backend
 ↓
Koha Login
 ↓
Receive CGISESSID
 ↓
Fetch Account Page
 ↓
Parse User Info
 ↓
Parse Loans
 ↓
Parse Fines
 ↓
Store in Redis
 ↓
Issue JWT
```

---

## Profile Page

```text
Flutter
 ↓
GET /account
 ↓
Redis
 ↓
Response
```

No Koha request required.

---

## Book Detail Page

```text
Flutter
 ↓
GET /books/{biblio_id}/user-status
 ↓
Redis Set Lookup
 ↓
Response
```

No Koha request required.

---

# Notes

* Do NOT store user passwords.
* Do NOT duplicate loans/fines in PostgreSQL.
* Koha remains the source of truth.
* Redis acts only as a session and performance cache.
* Availability checks and renewals should still contact Koha live.

